# FILE MAU DUOC COMMIT: chi giu placeholder, KHONG dien mat khau that o day.
#
# Cach dung:
#   1. Copy file nay thanh "application-local.properties" (bo duoi .example) trong cung
#      thu muc src/main/resources.
#   2. Dien mat khau/thong tin THAT cua may ban vao file moi tao.
#      Neu file private da ton tai, KHONG copy de len cau hinh da dien.
#   3. KHONG can dong sua gi trong application.properties nua - Spring se tu doc va
#      ghi de cac gia tri ben duoi tu application-local.properties (nho dong
#      application.properties da import file nay tu duong dan local).
#
# File application-local.properties da nam trong .gitignore. Tuy nhien .gitignore
# KHONG bao ve file da tracked va co the bi vuot qua bang git add -f: khong dung
# lenh nay voi file private. Chi file .example khong chua bi mat moi len Git.

# Database chi cau hinh bang config/aiven-local.properties.example.
# Khong dat spring.datasource.* tai day.

spring.mail.username=CHANGE_ME@gmail.com
spring.mail.password=CHANGE_ME
# Co the dung bien moi truong SMTP_USERNAME / SMTP_PASSWORD thay vi dien file private.
# Neu da co cau hinh local, giu nguyen; khong copy mau de len file da dien.

# Gia tri that can ngau nhien, toi thieu 32 byte; khong dung lai chuoi mau.
app.jwt.secret=CHANGE_ME_chuoi_ngau_nhien_toi_thieu_32_byte
